meta {
  name: Fetch data
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{dataEndpoint}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: {{dataAuthorization}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Run "management/Get transfer" first: it saves dataEndpoint and dataAuthorization.
  The provider fetches the dataset's portitor:source and streams it back: an http(s)
  URL, or since 1.1 an object of its own object storage, s3://{bucket}/{key}, read with
  its AWS_* keys (ADR 0027); 502 when the source fails, for both kinds. After
  "Complete transfer", or once the token expires, the answer is 401.
  Debug: data_plane.rs (crates/portitor-connector/src).
}
